  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The modern Manisa Ovas\u0131 (Manisa plain) in Turkey stretches to the north, west, and east of the modern city of Manisa (ancient Magnesia ad Sipylum). The plain surrounds the confluences of the Hyllos (modern Demirci \u00c7ay) and Pidasos (a tributary of Kum \u00c7ay) rivers with the Hermus (modern Gediz).",
